  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "sec_1df9ccec538847a984fa9143b69ba621",
      "title": "数学模型与符号约定",
      "numbering": "decimal",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "id": "p_425093eac66049f4bf67a6b8baa2aad3",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "信号示例写为 "
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "id": "n_ac741458e69049169b0510fa38493a8b",
              "latex": "i_L(t) = I_0 + \\Delta i\\sin(\\omega t)"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "，其中直流分量、纹波幅值与角频率应分别记录，避免只保存总波形而丢失生成条件。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "id": "p_4cd91b79791844a9bf4356ce2c564c1e",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "下列模型用于覆盖滤波、能量累积、状态空间、分段输入和状态导数的常见写法。它们展示不同的数学表达结构，不构成某一实际装置的完整模型。变量的数值应由具体项目参数表给出。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "id": "eq_baa387d508d84562bce348ca5763918f",
          "latex": "H(s)=\\frac{1}{LCs^2+RCs+1}",
          "numbered": true
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "id": "p_ce495f23c78241cea771e097baddd404",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "式（"
            },
            {
              "type": "ref",
              "id": "n_6eae5585a90c4bc8a76a8288c1f92a55",
              "target": "eq_baa387d508d84562bce348ca5763918f",
              "display": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "）描述二阶环节的形式。使用时应保持系数和自变量的量纲一致，并在比较结果前核对所采用的初始条件。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "id": "eq_3c7e92e8700249a690b06afd4b4cdf73",
          "latex": "E=\\int_0^T v(t)i(t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t",
          "numbered": true
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "id": "eq_5b13e2fd1adb4f8fa4b3a0e38dba3947",
          "latex": "\\mathbf{A}=\\begin{bmatrix}0&1\\\\-\\omega_0^2&-2\\zeta\\omega_0\\end{bmatrix}",
          "numbered": true
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "id": "eq_3ca3e23648494a9ca024774332d12b3c",
          "latex": "u(t)=\\begin{cases}U_{\\mathrm{dc}},&t\\geq 0\\\\0,&t<0\\end{cases}",
          "numbered": true
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "id": "eq_050b7979d161427e87496de71e9bbd04",
          "latex": "\\begin{aligned}v_L&=L\\frac{\\mathrm{d}i_L}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\\\i_C&=C\\frac{\\mathrm{d}v_C}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\end{aligned}",
          "numbered": true
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "id": "p_897c0e4db2ec4578ab7129c979f9c984",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "矩阵中的 A 使用粗体直立字母；函数名称与微分符号采用明确的数学排版。参数更改后应先核对公式语义，再检查图表与结论，不能以排版相似代替数学等价。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": [],
  "references": []
}
